-guide/sign-up-and-sign-in/","title":"Registration and sign-in","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"user-guide/social-features/","title":"Social features","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"user-guide/start-route-planning/","title":"Starting route planning","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"user-guide/system-requirements/","title":"System requirements","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/","title":"Charted","text":"<p>Todo description</p>"},{"location":"hu/#osszefoglalo","title":"\u00d6sszefoglal\u00f3","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/#a-dokumentacio-reszei","title":"A dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3 r\u00e9szei","text":"<ul> <li> <p> Bevezet\u00e9s</p> <p>Az alkalmaz\u00e1s bemutat\u00e1sa, a dolgozat c\u00e9lja \u00e9s hat\u00f3k\u00f6re, valamint a felhaszn\u00e1lt technol\u00f3gi\u00e1k.</p> <p> Tov\u00e1bb a bevezet\u00e9shez</p> </li> <li> <p> Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3i dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3</p> <p>Az alkalmaz\u00e1s haszn\u00e1lata a regisztr\u00e1ci\u00f3t\u00f3l a t\u00faratervez\u00e9sen \u00e9s r\u00f6gz\u00edt\u00e9sen \u00e1t a k\u00f6z\u00f6ss\u00e9gi funkci\u00f3kig.</p> <p> Tov\u00e1bb a felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3i dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3hoz</p> </li> <li> <p> Fejleszt\u0151i dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3</p> <p>Tervez\u00e9s, rendszerarchitekt\u00fara, backend, mobil alkalmaz\u00e1s, \u00fczemeltet\u00e9s \u00e9s tesztesetek.</p> <p> Tov\u00e1bb a fejleszt\u0151i dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3hoz</p> </li> <li> <p> \u00d6sszefoglal\u00e1s</p> <p>Neh\u00e9zs\u00e9gek \u00e9s megold\u00e1sok, valamint a V2 fejleszt\u00e9si lehet\u0151s\u00e9gei.</p> <p> Tov\u00e1bb az \u00f6sszefoglal\u00e1shoz</p> </li> </ul>"},{"location":"hu/#technologiak","title":"Technol\u00f3gi\u00e1k","text":"<ul> <li>Mobil: React Native, Expo, MapLibre</li> <li>Backend: NestJS BFF, PostgreSQL, PostGIS, TypeORM</li> <li>T\u00e9rk\u00e9p \u00e9s \u00fatvonaltervez\u00e9s: Valhalla, Martin</li> <li>Hiteles\u00edt\u00e9s: Keycloak (OAuth2, PKCE)</li> <li>Infrastrukt\u00fara: Docker Compose, Drone CI, k\u00e9t Raspberry Pi</li> </ul>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architectural-decisions/","title":"Architektur\u00e1lis d\u00f6nt\u00e9sek","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/","title":"Fejleszt\u0151i dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architecture/backend-and-bff/","title":"Backend \u00e9s BFF architekt\u00fara","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architecture/","title":"Rendszerarchitekt\u00fara","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architecture/infrastructure/","title":"Infrastrukt\u00fara","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architecture/methodology/","title":"Fejleszt\u00e9si m\u00f3dszertan","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/architecture/mobile-app/","title":"Mobil alkalmaz\u00e1s architekt\u00fara","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/api-endpoints/","title":"API v\u00e9gpontok dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3ja","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/authentication/","title":"Authentik\u00e1ci\u00f3","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/code-quality/","title":"K\u00f3dmin\u0151s\u00e9g \u00e9s dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/database/","title":"Adatb\u00e1zis modell \u00e9s entit\u00e1sok","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/gamification/","title":"Gamifik\u00e1ci\u00f3s logika","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/modules/","title":"Modulstrukt\u00fara","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/proxy-modules/","title":"Proxy modulok","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/backend/tech-stack/","title":"Technol\u00f3giai stack","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/developer-guide/deployment/configuration/","title":"K\u00f6rnyezeti v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k \u00e9s konfigur\u00e1ci\u00f3","text":"<p>TODO</p>"},{"location":"hu/develope